    {
      "text": "PRISMA flow diagram of study selection for STANDARD M10 and IRON-qPCR (Appendix 2B). From 37 database records (3 duplicates removed), 34 were screened, 32 excluded and 2 reports assessed; both were excluded (an ongoing trial and a conference abstract/case-control study). No studies were included.",
